{% comment %}
  Lightweight feed template for the YouTube reviews carousel.

  Assign this template to the review pages (video-reviews, video-reviews-2, ...).
  The carousel fetches each page with ?view=video-feed so it receives ONLY the
  page body (the YouTube embed iframes) with no header, footer, nav, or scripts.

  {% layout none %} strips all theme chrome, keeping the response tiny.
{% endcomment %}
